## Hard constraints (must never violate)
- Do not modify files under `.agents/` without explicit instruction.
- All changes to instruction and memory files must be reviewed; they are part of the operating rules.
- Prefer existing utilities and conventions over new ones.
- Never commit secrets or generated artifacts listed in `.gitignore`.
- Never rely on chat history as durable state. Continuity lives in files.

## Session Start Protocol (MANDATORY)
Before doing any work in a new session, you MUST:
1. Read `.agents/memory/current-status.md`.
2. Read `.agents/memory/decisions.md`.
3. Read any relevant handoff file under `.agents/handoffs/`.
4. Summarize the current status, relevant prior decisions, and the immediate next
   action before proceeding.

## During Work
- Keep changes scoped to the task at hand. Do not expand scope without recording it.
- Before any non-trivial change, read the relevant section of `.agents/references/`
  and the nearest `AGENTS.md`.
- After any non-trivial decision, append a structured entry to
  `.agents/memory/decisions.md` (append-only; never rewrite history).

## Session End / Handoff Protocol (MANDATORY)
Before ending a session with incomplete work, you MUST:
1. Write a complete handoff file using the template at
   `.agents/handoffs/template-handoff.md` and place it in `.agents/handoffs/`.
2. Update `.agents/memory/current-status.md` to reflect the new state.
3. Ensure any decisions made are recorded in `.agents/memory/decisions.md`.

## Multi-Agent Coordination
{% if include_multi_agent %}
- Role charters are defined in `.agents/agents/` (coordinator, implementer, reviewer).
  Respect their boundaries.
- Prefer Git worktrees for isolation when parallel agents may edit overlapping files.
{% if include_worktree_helpers %}
- Worktree helpers live under `.agents/worktrees/`; use them to create and manage
  isolated checkouts.
{% endif %}
- Coordinate via the shared memory files above; do not rely on ephemeral chat history.
{% else %}
- Multi-agent coordination is not currently enabled. If parallel agents are needed,
  enable it and add role charters under `.agents/agents/`.
{% endif %}
{% if include_volley_stubs %}
- Optional real-time coordination stubs live under `.agents/volley/`. The file-based
  drop-box remains primary; Volley is secondary and optional only.
{% endif %}

## Progressive Disclosure
This file is intentionally concise and always-on. Detailed guidance lives in
`.agents/skills/` (loaded on demand) and `.agents/references/` (loaded when relevant).
Do not expand this file into an encyclopedia.

## Definition of Done
- Tests pass.
- Lint / typecheck clean.
- Relevant decisions recorded in `.agents/memory/decisions.md`.
- Handoff file written if the work is incomplete or will continue in another session.
- `.agents/memory/current-status.md` updated.

